#: ../../library/aioble.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`aioble` --- Async BLE"
msgstr ":mod:`aioble` --- BLE asincrono"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:7
msgid ""
"aioble is a high-level asyncio-friendly wrapper around the :mod:`bluetooth` "
"module. It provides clean coroutines for scanning, connecting, advertising, "
"GATT services, and L2CAP channels."
msgstr ""
"aioble è un wrapper di alto livello, compatibile con asyncio, attorno al "
"modulo :mod:`bluetooth`\\ . Fornisce coroutine pulite per la scansione, la "
"connessione, l'advertising, i servizi GATT e i canali L2CAP."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:11
msgid ""
"All remote operations (connect, disconnect, client read/write, server "
"indicate, l2cap recv/send, pair) are awaitable and support timeouts."
msgstr ""
"Tutte le operazioni remote (connect, disconnect, lettura/scrittura del "
"client, indicate del server, recv/send L2CAP, pair) sono awaitable e "
"supportano i timeout."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:14
msgid "**Supported roles:**"
msgstr "**Ruoli supportati:**"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Broadcaster (advertiser)** --- generate advertising and scan-response "
"payloads for common fields, automatically split payload across advertising "
"and scan response, advertise indefinitely or for a fixed duration."
msgstr ""
"**Broadcaster (advertiser)** --- genera i payload di advertising e di scan-"
"response per i campi più comuni, suddivide automaticamente il payload tra "
"advertising e scan response, esegue l'advertising indefinitamente o per una "
"durata fissa."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Peripheral** --- wait for connection from a central, wait for MTU "
"exchange."
msgstr ""
"**Peripheral** --- attende una connessione da un central, attende lo scambio"
" MTU."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Observer (scanner)** --- passive and active scanning, combine advertising "
"and scan-response payloads for the same device, parse common fields from "
"advertising payloads."
msgstr ""
"**Observer (scanner)** --- scansione passiva e attiva, combina i payload di "
"advertising e di scan-response dello stesso dispositivo, analizza i campi "
"più comuni dai payload di advertising."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:25
msgid "**Central** --- connect to a peripheral, initiate MTU exchange."
msgstr "**Central** --- si connette a un peripheral, avvia lo scambio MTU."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:26
msgid ""
"**GATT Client** --- discover services / characteristics / descriptors "
"(optionally by UUID); read / write / write-with-response on characteristics "
"and descriptors; subscribe to notifications and indications (via the CCCD); "
"wait for notifications and indications."
msgstr ""
"**GATT Client** --- individua servizi / caratteristiche / descrittori "
"(opzionalmente per UUID); legge / scrive / scrive-con-risposta su "
"caratteristiche e descrittori; si iscrive a notifiche e indicazioni (tramite"
" il CCCD); attende notifiche e indicazioni."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:30
msgid ""
"**GATT Server** --- register services / characteristics / descriptors; wait "
"for writes on characteristics and descriptors; intercept read requests; send"
" notifications and indications (and wait on response)."
msgstr ""
"**GATT Server** --- registra servizi / caratteristiche / descrittori; "
"attende scritture su caratteristiche e descrittori; intercetta le richieste "
"di lettura; invia notifiche e indicazioni (e attende la risposta)."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:33
msgid ""
"**L2CAP** --- accept and connect L2CAP connection-oriented channels, manage "
"channel flow control."
msgstr ""
"**L2CAP** --- accetta e connette canali L2CAP orientati alla connessione, "
"gestisce il controllo di flusso del canale."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Security** --- JSON-backed key/secret management, initiate pairing, query "
"encryption / authentication state."
msgstr ""
"**Security** --- gestione di chiavi/segreti basata su JSON, avvio del "
"pairing, interrogazione dello stato di cifratura / autenticazione."

